// Accept twin of reject/E-KIND-SUBTYPE-CATEGORY/forged-island-category.ron:
// the declared `Island` row itself ([CR#205.3i] a Land subtype, via the
// builtin `BasicLandType` declaration) — the value the bare-name macro
// expands to AGREES with the registry, category column included.
Normal(
  name: "Accept Declared Island",
  types: [Land],
  supertypes: [Basic],
  subtypes: [Island],
)
